  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-30-53">朝ぎり　流れる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-53-67">山のみち</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-67-89">ほのぼの――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-89-112">草つぱ　ふんで</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-112-126">足のつゆ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-126-148">しつとり――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-148-171">蝶々は　ねてる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-171-188">ねむの葉に</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-188-210">ひつそり――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-210-233">匂ふよ　ほうら</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-233-247">栗のはな</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-247-269">ほんのり――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-269-295">ほういと呼んでる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-295-309">誰だろか</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-309-334">ほうい　と――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-334-357">きりに吸はれて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-357-371">細いこゑ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-371-392">ほうい　と――</seg></p>
    </body>
